1
00:00:00,157 --> 00:00:01,347
(Howard:)...I'll see you around.

2
00:00:01,859 --> 00:00:03,259
(Howard:)See you.

3
00:00:03,427 --> 00:00:04,897
(Raj:)No, wait.

4
00:00:05,062 --> 00:00:07,432
(Raj:)Take her number.
I don't want the temptation.

5
00:00:08,198 --> 00:00:09,688
(Leonard:)Okay.

6
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:15,207
(Raj:)I must be strong so I don't stray from
my true purpose: The study of the universe.

7
00:00:17,507 --> 00:00:18,907
(Sheldon:)All right.

8
00:00:25,449 --> 00:00:28,079
(Howard:)Thanks for ruining lobster for me.

9
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:35,150
(Raj:)Wait! Give me the number!

10
00:00:37,461 --> 00:00:40,261
(Raj:)Give me the number! Give me the number!

11
00:00:41,798 --> 00:00:44,928
(Leonard:)So, Amy, what's going on
with your addiction study?

12
00:00:45,736 --> 00:00:48,296
(Amy:)Sadly I'm no longer associated
with that project.

13
00:00:48,472 --> 00:00:51,412
- Why? What happened?
- Typical bureaucratic nonsense.

14
00:00:51,575 --> 00:00:55,605
(Amy:)You can get animals addicted to a harmful
substance, you can dissect their brains...

15
00:00:55,779 --> 00:01:01,019
...but you throw their own feces back at them
and suddenly you're unprofessional.

